WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:16.191
Some of my friends have dogs that work.

2
00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:18.836
My friend Tim cannot walk.

3
00:00:18.837 --> 00:00:25.337
His dog gets the newspaper. Good dog!

4
00:00:25.338 --> 00:00:27.957
My friend Susie cannot see.

5
00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:33.750
Her dog walks to school. Good dog!

6
00:00:33.751 --> 00:00:37.311
My friend Mr. Kim is a police officer.

7
00:00:37.312 --> 00:00:43.888
His dog catches criminals. Good dog!

8
00:00:43.889 --> 00:00:47.013
My friend Mr. Park is a soldier.

9
00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:56.463
His dog guards the gate. Good dog!

10
00:00:56.464 --> 00:00:59.975
My friend Mr. Lim works at the airport.

11
00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:10.810
His dog looks for drugs and bombs. Good dog!

12
00:01:10.811 --> 00:01:13.477
My friend Ann cannot hear.

13
00:01:13.478 --> 00:01:20.273
Her dog hears someone knocking. Good dog!

14
00:01:20.274 --> 00:01:23.311
My uncle Bob is a dogsled racer.

15
00:01:23.312 --> 00:01:30.434
His dogs pull the sled. Good dogs!

16
00:01:30.435 --> 00:01:32.157
I like my friends.

17
00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:37.297
I like their dogs too!
